          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP212 - Edmonton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice and easy, parked 1m away, the hole was cleaned, the cap was readable, zoom zoom off to the next one.  Go Go Final day.&lt;/p&gt;

