          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP212 Edmonton (104A St.)

Posted: N 53° 35.863 W 113° 30.050

My GPSr: N 53° 35.864 W 113° 30.054&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When GeoGuider and I got to this one, the coordinates took us out into the middle of the street. It didn’t take long to find after that. No numbers readable on the cap. Thanks for the brass cap, OFTH.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
